Proof: canonical selected runner reports 182 passed across 13 files; final lifecycle fixture lint cleanup rerun reports 15 passed. Ruff passes; code-health passes relative to dbef0c378e5d. Handoff, transaction-fence and final-revalidation removal mutants fail their targeted tests. No courier, deployment or publication changes.
